# Terraform working files. The repository root ignores state, lock files and
# .terraform directories; this file adds the variable files, which the
# terraform.tfvars.example headers promise are never committed. They hold
# certificate ARNs, hosted zone ids, alarm addresses and account numbers.
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Saved plans produced by the deploy workflow or a manual run.
*.tfplan

# Crash logs.
crash.log
crash.*.log
